  "notes": [
    "Search results come as compact arrays. The number at item[0] is an offset added to data.decode.minPostingId to get the posting id. [6,slug] holds the seo slug and [10,price] the price string.",
    "Listing URL: https://sfbay.craigslist.org/view/d/{slug}/{postingId}. Use get-postings for structured details.",
    "Location scopes: area/sfbay, subarea/{sfc|eby|sby|pen|nby|scz}, city/<slug> (e.g. city/oakland-ca).",
    "Replying to a listing requires an hCaptcha and is not supported."
  ],
